  "title": "Material variance investigation",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Material variance investigation</h2><p>Calculate signed variances using the actual-minus-standard convention; enter favorable variances as negative.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"bar-m1-tbs4-f1\">Signed material price variance</label><input id=\"bar-m1-tbs4-f1\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"bar-m1-tbs4-f2\">Signed material quantity variance</label><input id=\"bar-m1-tbs4-f2\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"bar-m1-tbs4-f3\">Net material cost variance</label><input id=\"bar-m1-tbs4-f3\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"bar-m1-tbs4-f4\">Recommended interpretation</label><select id=\"bar-m1-tbs4-f4\"><option value=\"Investigate quality and total cost, not price alone\">Investigate quality and total cost, not price alone</option><option value=\"Conclude the purchase was successful solely from price\">Conclude the purchase was successful solely from price</option><option value=\"Ignore complaints\">Ignore complaints</option><option value=\"Assume all variances are uncontrollable\">Assume all variances are uncontrollable</option></select></div></section>",
